OL,3,ACNN, MS NOW and Politico to file
OL,4,Alawsuit against Trump's White House ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FCNN, Politico and MS NOW have said they
OL,7,Fwill sue the Trump administration after
OL,8,Fthe three US media outlets were barred
OL,9,Ffrom the White House.
OL,11,FPresident Donald Trump announced the
OL,12,Fban on Friday, accusing the three
OL,13,Forganisations of writing "fiction or
OL,14,Flies" about his government.
OL,16,FThe companies said their reporters were
OL,17,Fdenied access and had their badges
OL,18,Fseized when attempting to access the
OL,19,Fbuilding on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/38
